    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p003",
      "kind": "definition",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সংজ্ঞা ১১ (সার্বিক ফাংশন).** একটি ফাংশন $f : A \\to B$ কে সার্বিক ফাংশন (onto function) বলা হবে যদি প্রত্যেক $b \\in B$ এর জন্য একটি $a \\in A$ পাওয়া যায় যেন $f(a) = b$ হয়। অর্থাৎ $B =$ রেঞ্জ $f$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f : A \\to B",
        "b \\in B",
        "a \\in A",
        "f(a) = b",
        "B =",
        "f"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 34,
      "pdfPageEnd": 34,
      "printedPageStart": 29,
      "printedPageEnd": 29,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩৪.** যদি $f : R \\to R$ এবং $g : R \\to R$ ফাংশন দুটি $f(x) = x + 5$ এবং $g(x) = x - 5$ দ্বারা সংজ্ঞায়িত হয়, তবে দেখাও যে, $f$ এর বিপরীত ফাংশন $g$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f : R \\to R",
        "g : R \\to R",
        "f(x) = x + 5",
        "g(x) = x - 5",
        "f",
        "g"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 34,
      "pdfPageEnd": 34,
      "printedPageStart": 29,
      "printedPageEnd": 29,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** $f$ ফাংশনটি এক-এক, কেননা\n$$f(x_1) = f(x_2)  হলে  x_1 + 5 = x_2 + 5  বা,  x_1 = x_2 ।$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f",
        "f(x_1) = f(x_2)  হলে  x_1 + 5 = x_2 + 5  বা,  x_1 = x_2 ।"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 35,
      "pdfPageEnd": 35,
      "printedPageStart": 30,
      "printedPageEnd": 30,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "আবার, $f$ ফাংশনটি সার্বিক, কেননা\n$$y = f(x)  হলে  x + 5 = y  বা,  x = y - 5 \\in R ।$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f",
        "y = f(x)  হলে  x + 5 = y  বা,  x = y - 5 \\in R ।"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 35,
      "pdfPageEnd": 35,
      "printedPageStart": 30,
      "printedPageEnd": 30,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "latin-junk",
        "verify-formula"
