      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "সুতরাং বিপরীত ফাংশন $f^{-1}$ বিদ্যমান।\n$$f^{-1}(x) = y  হলে  f(y) = x  বা,  y + 5 = x  বা,  y = x - 5$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f^{-1}",
        "f^{-1}(x) = y  হলে  f(y) = x  বা,  y + 5 = x  বা,  y = x - 5"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 35,
      "pdfPageEnd": 35,
      "printedPageStart": 30,
      "printedPageEnd": 30,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.31-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "আবার, $f^{-1}(x) = x - 5 = g(x)$\n$f^{-1}$ ও $g$ উভয়ের ডোমেন একই হওয়ায় $f^{-1} = g$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f^{-1}(x) = x - 5 = g(x)",
        "f^{-1}",
        "g",
        "f^{-1} = g"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 35,
      "pdfPageEnd": 35,
      "printedPageStart": 30,
